 📖 ABOUT THIS PROJECT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

WinTwin Fusion is a specialized Framework that allows you to create a complete
copy of your currently installed Windows 11 System. It can also be used to 
transform this data into a new, bootable Windows 11 installation Media.

This enables you to reinstall your current Windows System and pick up exactly
where you left off - only with a fresh Windows 11 installation.

No more data loss. No more new user profiles that require tedious setup after
installation. No more having to install additional software afterwards.
Everything is exactly where it was, as if nothing had ever happened.

